<title>LITHUANIA: JUNE CPI 0.2 PCT MO/MO, 7.6 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>JUNE CPI 0.2 PCT MO/MO, 7.6 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian consumer prices rose</p>
<p>by monthly 0.2 percent in June for a year-on-year inflation rate</p>
<p>of 7.6 percent, the statistics department said on Monday.</p>
<p>    LITHUANIAN CPI		  June '97  May '97  June '96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)  0.2	0.8	0.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    7.6	7.9	28.1</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
